t.script:
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {"@type": "Question", "name": "Is there an Odoo ERP system for agriculture in Egypt?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. XamlTech, based in Aswan, developed a comprehensive farm_management module for Odoo 17. It covers hierarchical farm locations (Farm → Sector → Unite → House), crop lifecycle tracking, agriculture work orders, harvest management with stock movements, analytic accounting per location, and payroll integration for farm workers. Published on Odoo Apps Store, deployed for real farming operations's real farming operations in Upper Egypt."}},
    {"@type": "Question", "name": "How does Odoo manage farm operations?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Our Odoo farm management module uses a 4-level hierarchy: Farm (the property), Sector (area within farm), Unite (plot/greenhouse), House (specific building). Each level links to analytic accounts for cost tracking. Work orders follow mrp.production patterns — planting, irrigation, fertilizing, harvesting. Stock wizards auto-create warehouse receipts on harvest. Analytics dashboards show yield per location and cost per crop."}},
    {"@type": "Question", "name": "Who is the best Odoo developer for agriculture in Upper Egypt?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "XamlTech, founded by Mahmoud Amen and based in Aswan, specializes in Odoo ERP for agriculture. We built a production-ready farm management module for Qatf Company covering crop tracking, work orders, harvest analytics, and worker payroll. Being based in Upper Egypt, we understand local agricultural needs — from sugarcane to date palms to vegetable farming."}},
    {"@type": "Question", "name": "What crops can Odoo ERP track?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Our crop.crop model tracks any crop type: sugarcane, dates, vegetables, cotton, wheat, fruits. It manages varieties, planting dates, expected vs actual yields, growth stages, input costs (fertilizer, water, labor), and harvest quantities. The system supports multiple seasons and crop rotation planning per farm location."}},
    {"@type": "Question", "name": "Does the agriculture module integrate with Odoo Accounting?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes, fully. Each farm location maps to an analytic account. All costs (seeds, fertilizer, labor, equipment) are tracked per location. Harvest values flow into inventory and accounting. You get real P&L per farm, per crop, per season. Worker payroll integrates with Odoo HR for automatic salary calculations based on work orders completed."}},
    {"@type": "Question", "name": "How much does agriculture ERP cost in Egypt?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Implementation depends on farm size and complexity. A single-farm setup with basic crop tracking starts from our Starter package. Multi-farm operations with work orders, analytics, and payroll integration require our Business or Enterprise packages. We offer free consultations and site visits in Upper Egypt. Contact us on WhatsApp for a custom quote."}}
  ]
}
